id: warriors-of-glass-first-effect
name: 1st effect of Warriors of Glass
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: warriors-of-glass
fromEffect: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Warriors of Glass's first effect, as a Maneuver: up to 8(bT) Ki, a Glass Soldier for every 2(bT) on a Glass Square.
text: >
  (1)-[1/Round, Ruling]: As a Standard Maneuver with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you can spend up to 8(bT) Ki Points. For every 2(bT) Ki Points spent, select a Square with the Glass Environmental Quality. Create a ‘Glass Soldier’ on that Square and remove the Glass Environmental Quality from that Square. A Glass Soldier is a Feature with the Resilient, Glass, and Reflective Environmental Qualities, and a Hardness Rank of 2 (before modification).

---

# The Liquid State's sixth effect's shape (liquid-sixth-effect.dbu): owned by every character, in the list only while
# Warriors of Glass is had (`fromTrait`). Used, how many Glass Soldiers asked - 2(bT) Ki each, 4 at most - paid, and said
# on a card of its own; the Squares are the table's (chat.mjs glassSoldiers).
[on used]
glassSoldiers();
